  "title": "Buttermilk Fried Chicken Wings",
  "description": "The bold flavors of the South inspired these tangy buttermilk fried wings. With the right balance of tang and heat, these wings are crunchy perfection.",
  "authors": [
    "Dav3d"
  ],
